    "body": "I looked into https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/523 and while it's somewhat close if you don't stress the somewhat horrible \"prose abort API\" (terminate a fetch), there's a few things left to figure out, including service workers. That's not going to happen within a week. So it's either this and Streams or just let it all be for another 5-6 weeks.",
