    "updated_at": "2017-07-10T12:26:41Z",
    "body": "It seems that for `fetch()` we're leaning towards exposing a copy of the signal that is passed to `Request`. Should we add advice to that effect here as a general pattern for exposing signals?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
